<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jun 17 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper down 1550, tin down 20, lead up 200, zinc up 25, aluminium down 4350, nickel up 60, aluminium alloy down 160</p>
